Someone asked for a list of the Elric Saga books by Michael Moorcock.
Here it is, IN ORDER OF STORY CHRONOLOGY. This is _not_ the order in
which they were published.

Elric of Melnibone'
The Fortress of the Pearl
The Sailer on the Seas of Fate
The Weird of the White Wolf
The Vanishing Tower
The Bane of the Black Sword
Stormbringer
Elric At the End of Time (retrospective essays and commentary)

The ORDER IN WHICH THEY WERE PUBLISHED (as far as I know) is:

Elric of Melnibone'
The Sailer on the Seas of Fate
The Weird of the White Wolf
The Vanishing Tower
The Bane of the Black Sword
Stormbringer
Elric At the End of Time (retrospective essays and commentary)
The Fortress of the Pearl

Any good library will have all the books (except, perhaps, Fortress of
the Pearl, 'cause it's new).

